WEBVTT

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:05.235
Open the start bearing of the saved residential 180 PFC beam.

00:00:05.235 --> 00:00:13.546
The ULS bearing action is 36.13 kN downwards. The native search selects two M16 bolts.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:18.644
The trial root fillets govern at 91.28%. The beam web, rupture paths and supporting member still need review.

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:24.167
Keep the 120 × 90 × 6 mm plate and 50 mm pitch, then try two M12 bolts under the same actions.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:29.303
Bolt shear now reaches 133.60%. The connection screen flags the failed component.

00:00:29.303 --> 00:00:32.989
Return to automatic sizing, save the geometry mode and reopen the private study.

00:00:32.989 --> 00:00:40.217
Read the worked bolt and weld equations in the browser. The engineer reviews the complete joint.
